{"verse_key": "10:53", "surah": 10, "verse": 53, "text_uthmani": "۞ وَيَسْتَنۢبِـُٔونَكَ أَحَقٌّ هُوَ ۖ قُلْ إِى وَرَبِّىٓ إِنَّهُۥ لَحَقٌّ ۖ وَمَآ أَنتُم بِمُعْجِزِينَ", "translation": "And they ask information of you, [O Muḥammad], \"Is it true?\" Say, \"Yes, by my Lord. Indeed, it is truth; and you will not cause failure [to Allāh].\"", "verse_from_ms": 1223340, "verse_to_ms": 1242960, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "۞", "start_ms": 1223340, "end_ms": 1226230}, {"i": 1, "text": "وَيَسْتَنۢبِـُٔونَكَ", "start_ms": 1226230, "end_ms": 1227220}, {"i": 2, "text": "أَحَقٌّ", "start_ms": 1227220, "end_ms": 1227840}, {"i": 3, "text": "هُوَ", "start_ms": 1227840, "end_ms": 1228940}, {"i": 4, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1228940, "end_ms": 1229320}, {"i": 5, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 1229320, "end_ms": 1232050}, {"i": 6, "text": "إِى", "start_ms": 1232050, "end_ms": 1233360}, {"i": 7, "text": "وَرَبِّىٓ", "start_ms": 1233360, "end_ms": 1235040}, {"i": 8, "text": "إِنَّهُۥ", "start_ms": 1235040, "end_ms": 1236990}, {"i": 9, "text": "لَحَقٌّ", "start_ms": 1236990, "end_ms": 1238260}, {"i": 10, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1238260, "end_ms": 1242485}, {"i": 11, "text": "وَمَآ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 12, "text": "أَنتُم", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 13, "text": "بِمُعْجِزِينَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}